A transparent binding model
[M]=\frac{M_T}{1+\beta[L]_{free}}
Only M and ML are included. Check ligand excess before replacing free ligand with a supplied value.

Separate mixing from reaction
C_{mix}=\frac{C_1V_1+C_2V_2}{V_1+V_2}
Use flows instead of volumes for a steady river junction.

Make stratospheric ozone
\mathrm{O_2}+h\nu\rightarrow2\mathrm{O} \mathrm{O+O_2+M\rightarrow O_3+M}
M carries away excess energy and is not consumed.

Close the two-phase balance
C_w=\frac{M_T}{V_w+K_dm_s}
Check both aqueous and sorbed inventories; neither is a concentration alone.
